# The browser page's texts (crates/sim-wasm/web/index.html); request kind 7 hands them out with the simulator's own.
web-title = Machine simulator
web-lead = The kinematics simulator, compiled to WebAssembly, runs the machine in this browser: in 3D as it moves, with time plots of torque, speed and following error, and as a sizing check against the motor, drive and part ratings. Nothing is sent anywhere.
